              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+Geometry+of+Physics+-+An+Introduction"} The Geometry of Physics - An Introduction
          %p
            Discussion of integration similarly with an eye towards applications in physics but from a more
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+abstract"} general abstract
            perspective is in
          %ul
            %li
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics"} geometry of physics
                –
                %a{:href => "geometry+of+physics#Integration"} integration
          %p
            A proof of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riesz+representation+theorem"} Riesz representation theorem
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive mathematics
            is given in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bas+Spitters"} Bas Spitters
              = succeed "," do
                %em Integrals and Valuations
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0808.1522"} arXiv:0808.1522
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.4115/jla.2009.1.3"} doi
          %p
            For the use of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integration"} integration
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"}> Igor Kriz
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %span.newWikiWord
                  Ales Pultr
                  %a{:href => "/nlab/new/Ales+Pultr"} ?
              = succeed "," do
                %em Categorical Geometry and Integration Without Points
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1101.3762"} arXiv:1101.3762
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s10485-012-9295-2"} doi:10.1007/s10485-012-9295-2
          %p
            For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integration"} integration
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive mathematics
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bas+Spitters"}> Bas Spitters
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Constructive algebraic integration theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.cs.au.dk/~spitters/ftop2.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apal.2005.05.031"} doi:10.1016/j.apal.2005.05.031
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bas+Spitters"}> Bas Spitters
                ,
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Constructive algebraic integration theory without choice
                = succeed "," do
